{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(You may consider this an EA title as I plan to expand content, adjust balance, optimize effects, etc. until this notice is removed.)<br><br><strong>Core Gameplay Loop</strong>: Build-Defend-Develop-Explore-Strike<br>As lord of a fief on mystical lands, develop your domain and bring lasting peace.<br><br>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Build</strong>: Construct walls to protect your territory, upgrade buildings to unlock new tech and units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/extras/2167438a0bb482f48ffce7ce94136777.webp?t=1766050630\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/extras/2167438a0bb482f48ffce7ce94136777.poster.webp?t=1766050630\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Defend</strong>: Recruit units to repel nightly monster attacks that intensify over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/extras/58bb925e9cd670dfcdc36568b6af459f.webp?t=1766050630\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/extras/58bb925e9cd670dfcdc36568b6af459f.poster.webp?t=1766050630\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Develop</strong>: Continuously expand your domain and strengthen your forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/extras/774d6f87ccab26e5d0a2ef5d4e535862.webp?t=1766050630\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/extras/774d6f87ccab26e5d0a2ef5d4e535862.poster.webp?t=1766050630\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Explore</strong>: Discover hidden surprises in the forests beyond your borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/extras/3b477b7eee26b1dbf0ab8a6ce3cc41f0.webp?t=1766050630\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/extras/3b477b7eee26b1dbf0ab8a6ce3cc41f0.poster.webp?t=1766050630\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Strike</strong>: Launch assaults on monster nests when your army is ready.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/extras/7e0434ad01d33e579c538e4e949fb2a2.webp?t=1766050630\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/extras/7e0434ad01d33e579c538e4e949fb2a2.poster.webp?t=1766050630\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As my first game since learning game development in early 2025, <i>Fief Lord</i> blends casual play with light strategy. This early release aims to gather player feedback for ongoing improvements.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650650?t=1766050630","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650650?t=1766050630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/d0983067c207dc13e2a3443a8a881a96cf052aa1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766050630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/d0983067c207dc13e2a3443a8a881a96cf052aa1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766050630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Shari